        "src/main/java/com/gtladd/gtladditions/common/machine/multiblock/part/ThreadPartMachine.kt",
        "src/main/java/com/gtladd/gtladditions/utils/ThreadMultiplierStrategy.kt"
      ],
      "modifications": "Extracted fixed station/thread/array constants, fair batch allocation, and normal aggregate energy rates; array allocation avoids the 64-bit bitmap edge case, and batch duration overflow is rejected. The optional hatch uses the default native machine multiplier two and accepts at most 64 ordinary arrays, each providing 128 additional threads. Thread/quota helpers use bounded arithmetic.",
      "license": "GPL-3.0-only"
    }
